するとか、技術技術してる。まぁ人を割り当てるときの助言とかもするので、完全にマネジメントしてないわけではないですが...\n\n会社によるとは思うのですが、一人で要件定義して仕様策定してスケジュール組んで着地まで出来る人って稀なんですよね〜","ts":"1627828633.020900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","UD1FQV38V","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xZpH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58e06b29-6ca6-40fb-8029-8a74cea9536f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"えっ、怪盗ロワイヤルまだ続いてたのか","ts":"1627828080.016000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zpv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1ffd654-9f69-4861-bb09-8eac39e07b54","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"日本、なぜか Individual Contributor の上位が People Manager になってましたからね。\nそれぞれ求められるスキルが違うのに、昇進の理由にスキルアップという概念がなかったのが原因。","ts":"1627824026.015500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PVTPm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9306cf92-2d56-43e8-8519-d393cf09d07e","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"10周年で売り上げ回復してるのでまだまだやっていきです","ts":"1627823697.012600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EyiUC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"469a8cb7-98a1-4a0d-819d-d6db121e183b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"怪盗ロワイヤル11周年に年季を感じる","ts":"1627823634.012500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1L13u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85802a89-da57-4aba-a03a-e0b5331dfb56","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"マネジメントは、難しい","ts":"1627823407.011600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1VC/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4002c0c7-a174-48f7-a827-24ea97524219","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"リーダーというかマネジメントに全く興味が無くて困る","ts":"1627823392.011400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GZ0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"656f0ead-eb27-43f8-94d6-d4e1531d05c2","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; でも世間的にはリーダーの方が待遇いいんですよねぇ。希少価値を考えればそれはそうなんだろうけど、つらい\nプログラマーの価値も上げていきたい","ts":"1627823383.011100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TZc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b7bd725-7f71-4e9f-8de2-86aeb996783f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"eihighさん、DeNAだったのか","ts":"1627823357.010700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5a2t9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ed54c6d-e18b-4a32-8d90-a7a7b70a4d2e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私、そこそこキャリアは長いけどいわゆるリーダーと言うポジションをやったことがなくて、自分自身リーダーは向いていないと思っていて、でも世間的にはリーダーの方が待遇いいんですよねぇ。希少価値を考えればそれはそうなんだろうけど、つらい","ts":"1627823346.010500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5xdlO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c94efe7-e6a2-45f2-bb9b-534ee9581616","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ヘーシャではあのタイトルの運営が始まってたので宣伝しますね\n採用もガンガンやってます\n\u003chttps://denagames-tokyo.com/\u003e","ts":"1627822848.008700","attachments":[{"fallback":"DeNA Games Tokyo","id":1,"title":"DeNA Games Tokyo","title_link":"https://denagames-tokyo.com/","text":"ゲーム運営のプロフェッショナルDeNA Games Tokyo(DGT)。DeNAが培ったゲーム運営ノウハウを用い、長期に渡ってユーザーファーストなゲーム運営を実現しています。","image_url":"https://denagames-tokyo.com/wp-content/uploads/index.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"denagames-tokyo.com","service_icon":"https://s0.wp.com/i/webclip.png","from_url":"https://denagames-tokyo.com/","original_url":"https://denagames-tokyo.com/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FbNw"}]}]
